<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - USX-Marathon said raised.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - USX-Marathon said raised.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- PaineWebber raised its recommendation on USX-Marathon Group to buy from attractive, according to a source at PaineWebber.</p>
<p>-- Shares rose 7/8 to 24-3/4 in morning New York Stock Exchange trade.</p>
</text>
